p/<run-id>/ namespace ... A concurrent or stale lock fails closed ... names a fresh-clone retry ... After abnormal termination, discard that clone and retry in a fresh unfiltered clone') and final bullet ('Run against a fresh real unfiltered clone'); ACs 'A second overlapping run fails without deleting the first run refs' and 'A stale helper lock fails closed with a fresh-clone retry'.","norm_id":"nece39b7157a1ddbd","priority":0.402,"reason":"default-advisory","scenarios":["Two operators launch the helper concurrently; if each uses its own fresh clone, neither sees the other's lock and both proceed, so the lock protects nothing.","Abnormal termination leaves a lock in a repo, but the prescribed recovery (fresh clone) never encounters that lock, so the 'stale-lock fails closed with fresh-clone retry' path is unreachable in the fresh-clone model."],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.75,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"medium","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"moderate","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"medium"}}},{"block_threshold":null,"blocking_enabled":null,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["P4"],"decision":"advisory","drop_reason":null,"evidence":["30 acceptance-criteria items (> 25)"]